{"samples":[{"adjacent_segments":[{"asset_ref":"asset:primary:hlm:zhihui:v3.1416:pdf","chapter":41,"classification":{"human_review":"PENDING","method":"DECLARED_PDF_TYPOGRAPHY_V2","reasons":["DECLARED_ANNOTATION_COLOR","WITNESS_LABEL_GLYPH"],"styles":[{"color":1865405,"font":"00-GBK-EUC-H","size":15.61},{"color":1865405,"font":"KaiTi-GBK-EUC-H","size":15.58}]},"dataset_ref":"corpus:front80:v2-candidate","kind":"ZHIPI","locator":{"extraction_ref":"asset:sha256:1c9dee98f867ea07dade7b69b2b8d3987c5046ddb51e1e377c5e306fd26ba900","spans":[{"end":238,"start":198,"unit_ref":"pdf:page:563"}],"transforms":[]},"record_type":"SEGMENT","section_ref":"chapter:41","segment_id":"hlm80:chapter:41:p00005","text":"戚任呼牛马从来乐，随分清高方可安。自古世情难意拟，\n淡妆浓抹有千般。立松轩。 \n","text_sha256":"b93a9caed9cccac22e07b79134de4af42bf45c7e8972ced33acb98955897eca2"},{"asset_ref":"asset:primary:hlm:zhihui:v3.1416:pdf","chapter":41,"classification":{"human_review":"PENDING","method":"DECLARED_PDF_TYPOGRAPHY_V2","reasons":["DECLARED_MAIN_FONT_SIZE_COLOR"],"styles":[{"color":2301728,"font":"SimSun-GBK-EUC-H","size":15.58}]},"dataset_ref":"corpus:front80:v2-candidate","kind":"MAIN_TEXT","locator":{"extraction_ref":"asset:sha256:1c9dee98f867ea07dade7b69b2b8d3987c5046ddb51e1e377c5e306fd26ba900","spans":[{"end":553,"start":238,"unit_ref":"pdf:page:563"}],"transforms":[]},"record_type":"SEGMENT","section_ref":"chapter:41","segment_id":"hlm80:chapter:41:p00006","text":" \n  话说刘姥姥两只手比着说道：“花儿落了结个大倭瓜。”\n众人听了哄堂大笑起来。于是吃过门杯，因又逗趣笑道：“实\n告诉说罢，我的手脚子粗笨，又喝了酒，仔细失手打了这磁杯。\n有木头的杯取个子来，我便失了手，掉了地下也无碍。”众人\n听了，又笑起来。 \n  凤姐儿听如此说，便忙笑道：“果真要木头的，我就取了\n来。可有一句话先说下：这木头的可比不得磁的，他都是一套，\n定要吃遍一套方使得。”刘姥姥听了心下敁敠道：“我方才不\n过是趣话取笑儿，谁知他果真竟有！我时常在村庄乡绅大家也\n赴过席，金杯银杯倒都也见过，从来没见有木头杯之说。哦，\n是了，想必是小孩子们使的木碗儿，不过诓我多喝两碗。别管\n他，横竖这酒蜜水儿似的，多喝点子也无妨。”","text_sha256":"1b21c675f945ce41f8c54b3c5f86cd3c8fc9b82d07ab557480b4ab7ad3fe0c2a"},{"asset_ref":"asset:primary:hlm:zhihui:v3.1416:pdf","chapter":41,"classification":{"human_review":"PENDING","method":"DECLARED_PDF_TYPOGRAPHY_V2","reason