_LABEL_GLYPH"],"styles":[{"color":1865405,"font":"00-GBK-EUC-H","size":15.61},{"color":1865405,"font":"KaiTi-GBK-EUC-H","size":15.58}]},"dataset_ref":"corpus:front80:v2-candidate","kind":"ZHIPI","locator":{"extraction_ref":"asset:sha256:1c9dee98f867ea07dade7b69b2b8d3987c5046ddb51e1e377c5e306fd26ba900","spans":[{"end":236,"start":183,"unit_ref":"pdf:page:647"}],"transforms":[]},"record_type":"SEGMENT","section_ref":"chapter:48","segment_id":"hlm80:chapter:48:p00009","text":"戚心地聪明性自灵，喜同雅品讲诗经，姣柔倍觉可怜形。 \n皓齿朱唇真袅袅，痴情专意更娉娉，宜人解语小星星。 \n","text_sha256":"a8235dee8869da3d18e0e98c654f228a4af6802ed1c241fd84ab958f1bd6082d"},{"asset_ref":"asset:primary:hlm:zhihui:v3.1416:pdf","chapter":48,"classification":{"human_review":"PENDING","method":"DECLARED_PDF_TYPOGRAPHY_V2","reasons":["DECLARED_MAIN_FONT_SIZE_COLOR"],"styles":[{"color":2301728,"font":"SimSun-GBK-EUC-H","size":15.58}]},"dataset_ref":"corpus:front80:v2-candidate","kind":"MAIN_TEXT","locator":{"extraction_ref":"asset:sha256:1c9dee98f867ea07dade7b69b2b8d3987c5046ddb51e1e377c5e306fd26ba900","spans":[{"end":593,"start":236,"unit_ref":"pdf:page:647"}],"transforms":[]},"record_type":"SEGMENT","section_ref":"chapter:48","segment_id":"hlm80:chapter:48:p00010","text":" \n  且说薛蟠听见如此说了，气方渐平。三五日后，疼痛虽愈，\n伤痕未平，只装病在家，愧见亲友。 \n  展眼已到十月，因有各铺面伙计内有算年账要回家的，少\n不得家内治酒饯行。内有一个张德辉，年过六十，自幼在薛家\n当铺内揽总，家内也有二三千金的过活，今岁也要回家，明春\n方来。因说起“今年纸札香料短少，明年必是贵的。明年先打\n发大小儿上来当铺内照管照管，赶端阳前我顺路贩些纸札香扇\n来卖。除去关税花销，亦可以剩得几倍利息。”薛蟠听了，心\n中忖度：“我如今捱了打，正难见人，想着要躲个一年半载，\n又没处去躲。天天装病，也不是事。况且我长了这么大，文又\n不文，武又不武，虽说做买卖，究竟戥子算盘从没拿过，地土\n风俗远近道路又不知道，不如也打点几个本钱，和张德辉逛一\n年来。赚钱也罢，不赚钱也罢，且躲躲羞去。二则逛逛山水也\n","text_sha256":"09997eaf9858899a0f972d39669073df3267e4094808d27af57ba15b73ed816b"},{"asset_ref":"asset:primary:hlm:zhihui:v3.1416:pdf","chapter":48,"classification":{"human_review":"PENDING","method":"DECLARED_PDF_TYPOGRAPHY_V2","reasons":["HEADER_FOOTNOTE_TITLE_OR_COLLATION_MARKER","INVISIBLE_TEXT"],"styles":[{"color":2301728,"font":"KaiTi-GBK-EUC-H","size":10.38},{"color":16777215,"font":"TimesNewRoma