我写出来。”说着，\n便令众人拈阄为序。起首恰是李氏。","text_sha256":"fba0cdbd0e7ab97b0f40054f4aafda311cbc0e28989aa4b39f29f994d984602e"},{"asset_ref":"asset:primary:hlm:zhihui:v3.1416:pdf","chapter":50,"classification":{"human_review":"PENDING","method":"DECLARED_PDF_TYPOGRAPHY_V2","reasons":["DECLARED_ANNOTATION_COLOR","WITNESS_LABEL_GLYPH"],"styles":[{"color":8032840,"font":"00-GBK-EUC-H","size":12.15},{"color":8032840,"font":"KaiTi-GBK-EUC-H","size":12.11}]},"dataset_ref":"corpus:front80:v2-candidate","kind":"ZHIPI","locator":{"extraction_ref":"asset:sha256:1c9dee98f867ea07dade7b69b2b8d3987c5046ddb51e1e377c5e306fd26ba900","spans":[{"end":228,"start":195,"unit_ref":"pdf:page:671"}],"transforms":[]},"record_type":"SEGMENT","section_ref":"chapter:50","segment_id":"hlm80:chapter:50:p00005","text":"庚一定要按次序，恰又不按次序，\n似脱落处而不脱落，文章歧路如此。\n","text_sha256":"d3a1a11deed10ee72a7534def350a2c308de2a432557a7620ac555081d5bae01"}],"page_navigation":[{"end":195,"exact_span_text":" \n  话说薛宝钗道：“到底分个次序，让我写出来。”说着，\n便令众人拈阄为序。起首恰是李氏。","extraction_text_sha256":"0649c2abb0fb17958f2bbb56afb4bfc3486056e2889bef2476d2cf6727dd7ccb","full_pdf":{"asset_ref":"asset:primary:hlm:zhihui:v3.1416:pdf","path":"sources/primary/hongloumeng/zhihui/v3.1416/original.pdf","sha256":"37441da3cb438d1b3eab2b511aa6f1695f309192fa63bea842413ff91655c1d7"},"pdf_page_index_zero_based":670,"physical_page_one_based":671,"start":149,"unit_ref":"pdf:page:671","viewer_fragment":"#page=671"}],"sample":{"reason":"MAIN_TEXT coverage of chapter 50","segment_id":"hlm80:chapter:50:p00004","text_sha256":"fba0cdbd0e7ab97b0f40054f4aafda311cbc0e28989aa4b39f29f994d984602e"},"segment":{"asset_ref":"asset:primary:hlm:zhihui:v3.1416:pdf","chapter":50,"classification":{"human_review":"PENDING","method":"DECLARED_PDF_TYPOGRAPHY_V2","reasons":["DECLARED_MAIN_FONT_SIZE_COLOR"],"styles":[{"color":2301728,"font":"SimSun-GBK-EUC-H","size":15.58}]},"dataset_ref":"corpus:front80:v2-candidate","kind":"MAIN_TEXT","locator":{"extraction_ref":"asset:sha256:1c9dee98f867ea07dade7